zjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftewlHyJdVW1Z0WiWxJkusU9m81HQwpsU4MXmGdrSdQUA&oe=699B0EEC"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "1423632349004757", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391950_1423632352338090_4524777843854749483_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m_bkDv2aSR8Q7kNvwFw9t2G&_nc_oc=AdlF0noSBJQhX4N1aPNG9R4_czq356zXLR4V6jrzWQPg-RHLNk0pTJrBed5yVQ47L3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuNFi2utNIPJQJcAm3sY0lzdz0XH0qaw6x_6b8Rxiusyg&oe=699AFB14"}, {"file_name": "02.png", "id": "1161324799063900", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391860_1161324802397233_129808103212474493_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TquSI-aPGk0Q7kNvwHM3GAh&_nc_oc=AdkT-0cC8MCYP1sIBUXOX_xO6TdInRe-946g1MgaaOmjwXNzyxY2Zm6uTz46CHwXVZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvktewLcDeNG1P3XuRkVPrhK2qMsetW_VEWfU9oxPTQsA&oe=699AE665"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "1548219542522619", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392104_1548219545855952_3726187648419365918_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jM_Rgygm78UQ7kNvwGX0WHa&_nc_oc=AdkvnQ4Yb4cFI2JByDn41VFIVLRs1bI7NYIIgce8YWijvH-iUea-LC4hnDmXLilt3Yc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsaocj7BrrFUQNcA8R8rGe2iPiyThncncJHa2V0y1oHeg&oe=699B0858"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Where on Earth", "keywords": ["Earth", "World", "Guess", "Travel", "Geo"], "long_description": "From the creators of Wooorld comes Where On Earth\u2014a thrilling, fully social VR location-guessing game where your detective skills and knowledge of the world is put to the test!\n\nStep into immersive real-world locations, search for clues, and pinpoint your location on the map. Play solo, cooperatively with friends, or head-to-head in intense team battles. Explore in 360\u00b0, using intuitive tools like the magnifier, compass and laser pointer to share insights and strategize in real time.\n\n**How it works**:\n\n**\ud83d\udd0e Explore & Investigate** \u2013 Jump to different 360\u00b0 spots, zoom in on details, and analyze your surroundings for clues.\n\n**\ud83d\udccd Make Your Guess** \u2013 Drop a pin on the map and lock in your answer. The closer you are, the higher you score!\n\n**\ud83d\udc65 Team Up or Compete** \u2013 Work together in Co-op Mode or challenge opponents in VS Mode, where teams battle to outguess each other.\n\n**\ud83c\udf0d Social at its core** \u2013 Experience real multiplayer presence with 3D avatars, shared laser pointers, and fun mechanics like seamless teleportation.\n\nWhether you're a geography pro or just love the thrill of discovery, Where On Earth offers an exciting way to test your skills and explore the world\u2014without leaving home.\n\n**Think fast, guess smarter, and prove you know the world!**", "short_description": "From the creators of Wooorld, Where On Earth is the ultimate social VR location-guessing game! Drop into real-world locations, search for clues, and guess where you are. Play together in Co-op or battle it out in VS Mode. Explore in 360\u00b0, use laser pointers to highlight clues, and work together -or against each other- to win. Think you know the world? Prove it!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wooorld.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wooorld Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://wooorld.io/", "website_url": "https://wooorld.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommen